    <title>Sicilian-style sausages and peppers with herby polenta</title>
    <updated>2026-09-12T17:05:47.169488+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Sicilian-style sausages and peppers with herby polenta&lt;/h1&gt;
