        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/sicilian-style-sausages-and-peppers-with-herby-polenta.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;For a summery take on bangers and mash, pile sweet-and-sour peppers onto herby polenta and top with juicy Sicilian-style fennel sausages. Swap the parsley for basil, if you prefer&lt;/p&gt;</content>
