    <id>https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/bo-kho-style-steak-and-lemongrass-pie</id>
    <title>Bò Kho-style steak and lemongrass pie</title>
    <updated>2026-09-12T17:05:47.169104+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Bò Kho-style steak and lemongrass pie&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/bo-kho-style-steak-and-lemongrass-pie.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;I recently went through a stage of making everything into a pie, as I discovered pre-made pastry at my local supermarket. This particular recipe is like a Vietnamese Bò Kho – a traditional, rich and comforting beef stew – meets a classic steak pie, and it’s a match made in heaven! I hope you enjoy it as much as I do.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/bo-kho-style-steak-and-lemongrass-pie"/>
